  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: X4
  Title: Inside a Layout Group
  Summary: A Layout Group places its children itself, and fights position steps on
    them.
  Watch: List
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 216721583}
  HowTo: Preview Move Row and Move Inner. Then try both in play mode (select the
    tile and use its Play buttons), and resize the Game view while Row 1 is moved.
  Expect: 'Moving the row itself is undone by the layout whenever it rebuilds (in
    play mode at the latest); moving the Inner child of Row 2 works and stays. The
    recommended fix: animate a child inside each item.'
  Needs: 3
  Style: 0
