  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: X2
  Title: A property that throws
  Summary: Bomb's Explodes property throws whenever it is read. Go animates it, and
    spins Safe.
  Watch: Bomb, Safe
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 746521613}
  - {fileID: 316315263}
  HowTo: Preview Go, then Stop and Restore. Enter play mode and click Go a few times.
  Expect: The Explodes step warns once and is skipped; Safe spins every time; no
    exception escapes, and Stop and Restore still puts everything back.
  Needs: 19
